WEBVTT

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.530
Where am I?

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.150
Oh, right. Chris!

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:14.850
Shinyao.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.580
Sorry for making you worry,

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:21.010
but it's all right now.

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:23.080
There's nothing to worry about.

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:28.520
Is she seeing something we aren't?

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.800
It's the new version of Magic Mirror.

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:35.430
I'm sending false data not just to her vision, 
 but to all five of her senses.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:38.210
So it's like VR.

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:41.180
But is she really so easily manipulated?

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:45.600
People see what they want to see 
and believe what they want to believe.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.150
It's the reason Umbra exist.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:32.750
<b>Episode 10 
The Day Before Everything Ends</b>

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:34.770
It's no use.

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:38.380
Since I can't access the internet,
 I don't know what our enemies are doing.

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:42.760
The moment we investigate their 
movements, they'll know our location.

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:46.330
We can't afford to be attacked right now.

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:49.280
Lady Ton would end up fighting again.

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:53.070
If she uses any more of her strength, she'll...

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:57.550
Why don't we check the radio?

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:00.110
I'll do it.

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:02.780
Let's let Luke handle the rest.

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:07.220
It's only analog, but there's no denying 
his ears and nose are useful right now.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:08.500
<i>Pleasant weather in the city right now—</i>

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:09.420
<i>Regarding the sequence of events—</i>

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:10.140
<i>The band is—</i>

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:10.910
<i>It's actually—</i>

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:15.360
<i>I'm checking all the radio broadcasts I can,</i>

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:18.420
<i>but there's no mention
 of yesterday's commotion.</i>

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:21.770
Detective Gregory couldn't 
have done this alone.

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:25.970
Our enemies must have someone skilled 
in information control as well.

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.890
Could it be the Magic Mirror app?

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:31.530
What do you think?

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:33.810
Do you think they're still alive?

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:35.900
For now, we can only believe they are.

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:37.860
Shinyao is alive.

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:42.850
They weren't pursuing them 
to retaliate against Chris.

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:48.700
They needed to capture Shinyao 
alive for some other purpose.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:51.980
I see. Then there's still hope.

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:53.580
But what about Chris?

00:03:55.660 --> 00:04:01.000
Why do they need Lady Shinyao?

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:04.180
Could she be bait for Miss Ton?

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:07.540
No. If they want Ton to use her power,

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:10.110
they simply need to unleash 
a powerful Umbra on the city.

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:13.690
They proved that last night.

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:15.650
Why, then?

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:19.130
Unfortunately, I don't know that either.

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:25.260
The one thing I can say is we can't 
let Ton continue to be involved.

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:29.130
What happened to him?

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:32.080
He died protecting me from the humans.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.990
Oh, no. Again?

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:40.540
We're living lives of sin based 
on their numerous sacrifices.

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:53.840
My Magic Mirror was 
officially a counseling app

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:56.850
that resolved people's problems.

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:58.980
But its real goal was...

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:01.000
To control people.

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:04.740
Counseling and brainwashing 
are two sides of the same coin.

00:05:05.140 --> 00:05:08.770
Providing accurate information 
erases human fear

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:11.980
and suppresses Umbra outbreaks.

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:12.950
However...

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:17.330
It's also easy to fan the flames 
of fear and irritability.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:20.590
By simply providing them with an escape,

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:26.180
people will always make choices 
that are convenient for us.

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:31.680
Save him, Shinyao.

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:04.860
How are you doing?

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:06.260
Were you able to rest?

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:08.590
I don't need rest.

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:10.790
I'm not tired.

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:12.930
I've been overflowing with power.

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:15.010
I could fight right now

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:17.690
if I knew where Shinyao was.

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:20.810
Unfortunately, we still 
don't have any information.

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:25.900
Ton.

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.370
What?

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:29.780
Take off the ring.

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:33.170
Then you can sleep.

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:34.890
Your hair will go back to normal.

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:36.000
And—

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:39.060
And I'll never be able to save Shinyao again.

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:43.940
I... We'll save her.

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:44.990
So—

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:47.030
I can't just wait!

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:48.550
That's not me!

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:56.990
There was once a human 
who said the same thing.

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:01.790
There was a hero who never stopped fighting

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:04.980
for the happiness of others, even if 
it meant becoming an Umbra herself.

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:07.850
What happened to her?

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:11.390
She disappeared from me and the world.

00:07:12.770 --> 00:07:18.290
Now she's just a small legend that 
remains in the memories of only a few.

00:07:18.900 --> 00:07:21.930
How did you feel about her?

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.100
It was a hundred years ago.

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:25.290
I don't remember.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:31.570
What I do remember is that I regret 
not keeping her in this world

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:35.010
so she could be happy, too.

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:39.020
Do you think my
 great-grandmother wanted that?

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:41.660
I'm not talking about how she felt.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:44.230
I'm saying that would've made her happy.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.230
You're wrong.

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.360
You're the one who wanted that.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.190
It only would've made you happy.

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:53.820
Stop comparing me to Sha Rijan.

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:58.530
Stop using me to erase the regret 
you experienced over her!

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:03.830
Even so, I don't want to lose this again.

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:07.770
For a hundred years, 
because of a promise I made Rijan,

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:10.420
I've forbidden myself from 
drinking human blood.

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:14.130
Are you going to use your vampire 
powers to make me obey you?

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:19.060
If you insist on charging ahead
even if it means becoming an Umbra,

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:24.060
then I, Vlad Garfunkel, 
will lift that restriction.

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:27.230
You think you could beat me right now?

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:32.800
That's right. You haven't drunk human 
blood in almost a hundred years.

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:35.910
You must be weaker than when my 
great-grandmother was around.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.240
So, what?

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:41.590
I've regained the power of Sha Rijan.

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:43.210
Do you really think you can beat me?

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:51.030
I'm sorry.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:55.580
But leave me alone.

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:06.540
Chris, where are you?

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:19.110
What's going on?

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:35.610
You should hide that hair.

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:40.280
Sorry.

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:42.770
I heard that incompetent 
vampire ran out of control.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:46.120
They're lecturing him right now.

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:47.600
Forgive him.

00:09:48.070 --> 00:09:49.900
You have nothing to apologize for.

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:52.350
Did you find Chris?

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:57.030
Nope. His scent ended downstream.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:58.820
I don't know where he went after that.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:01.140
He's probably alive.

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:01.990
Maybe.

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:05.900
Let's rescue him.

00:10:05.900 --> 00:10:08.620
No, there's no need for us to save him.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:09.920
Why not?

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:15.960
Because Chris is no longer that guy 
who was losing the will to live.

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:20.700
Now he has a reason to live.

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:23.970
He has to protect Shinyao's happiness.

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:26.010
He can't afford to die.

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:30.730
He's like me now. A strong, proud wolf.

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:35.110
So I don't need to save my brother.

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:37.950
What are you going to do now, then?

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:39.450
Save Shinyao.

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:43.270
Not to protect Chris, but to protect his wish.

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:45.660
To protect Shinyao's happiness.

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:48.180
I want to save Shinyao, too.

00:10:48.590 --> 00:10:51.790
That would make me happiest right now.

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:58.630
But even if I'm able to save 
Shinyao using my powers, I...

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:05.880
Hey, Ton. Let us handle Shinyao.

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:07.140
You, too?

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:09.080
Just so you know,

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:12.020
I'm not saying that because of some childish 
sense of possessiveness like he is.

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:17.740
I want you to have a happy college 
life with Shinyao as a human.

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:22.970
I want both of you
 to visit our café as humans.

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:25.380
I want you to interact with 
Umbra as humans there.

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:28.910
I want you to be friends with us forever.

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:32.330
I want you to bridge the gap 
between humans and Umbra.

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.770
I wanted my pack to do that.

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:41.400
But, this time, I want you to 
be what wasn't because of me.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:50.070
I'm sorry for running off by myself.

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:53.980
I'm glad you're safe. 
I was worried they'd find you.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.400
Welcome back, Lady Ton.

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:01.490
Where's Vlad?

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:05.250
After getting an earful from me and 
Toryu, he ran out the door crying.

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:07.870
He was sulking, but he wasn't crying.

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:10.180
We get it.

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:13.340
I see. I wanted to apologize to him.

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:15.080
That's not necessary.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:15.750
But—

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:18.910
And there's no need to 
criticize him anymore, either.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:21.840
He has been sufficiently punished.

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:27.100
A hundred years ago, 
he and I lost someone important.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:30.040
That has nothing to do with me.

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:32.640
But if the same thing were to happen now,

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:34.900
that would be the result of your choice.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:39.670
Toryu, are you opposed to me fighting, too?

00:12:39.670 --> 00:12:43.650
Like Luke and Vlad, do you want 
me to wait here for your return?

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:48.450
I want you to be true to yourself.

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:49.360
What?

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:54.030
If you're willing to sacrifice 
yourself to save your friend,

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:55.460
I won't stop you.

00:12:56.570 --> 00:13:01.920
But if you fight and endanger yourself,

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:05.430
I will remove this talisman once again.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:07.010
That's not fair.

00:13:07.610 --> 00:13:10.170
If you do that, this time you'll...

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:13.250
But unless I do, this time you will...

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:22.280
I will not allow you to leave us.

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:25.150
I don't care what you become.

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:30.620
I just want you to always 
remain within reach.

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:35.210
We were waiting for 
Lady Rijan to return to us.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:39.410
Please don't make us wait, Lady Ton.

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:42.420
I don't want that either.

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:45.570
I don't want to disappear. 
I want to remain human.

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:48.170
I want to come home to you guys.

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.830
Just listening to you is embarrassing me.

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:56.640
Where have you been, you useless vampire?

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:58.780
Let's do this, Luke.

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:00.310
Guys, get ready.

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:02.520
What? Do what?

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:05.020
Isn't it obvious?

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:07.400
We're having afternoon tea.

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:12.410
Why do they keep appearing?

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:16.290
They weren't born because they wanted to be.

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:17.790
They're at the mercy of humans.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.380
They're pathetic.

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:24.090
Are you saying that humans... 
that we're responsible?

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:27.520
I have to do something.

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.890
You're saving them.

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:33.000
Grant them peace.

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:35.980
Okay, Chris.

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:11.420
You're incredible, Little Shinyao.

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:14.680
I've never seen a human who can 
so completely merge with Umbra.

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:18.330
A hundred years ago, shamans who could merge

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:21.690
their consciousness with 
Umbra weren't so uncommon.

00:15:21.910 --> 00:15:26.140
I wonder why this power awakened in her now.

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:33.450
Like Baileu Ton, she may be 
related to Sha Rijan or myself.

00:15:33.710 --> 00:15:37.060
In any case, she's a modern-day miracle.

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:39.140
An ancient madonna.

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:41.420
With her, I can destroy the Umbra.

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:43.920
Fear will disappear from this world.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:47.550
Not that I care about that.

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:51.090
All you desire is wealth and fame.

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:54.710
I don't want to be called "backup" forever.

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:58.180
I'll start by becoming 
Midnight Sun's "control."

00:15:58.550 --> 00:16:02.710
If you ask me, how you live is more important

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:05.650
than what people think of you.

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:07.770
You're wrong.

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:12.600
How you're remembered is more important.

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:16.780
I'll carve my existence into this world.

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:19.630
Are you trying to become a legend?

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:23.710
An Umbra version of you 
may be born eventually.

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:29.190
You hid in the shadow of history 
for over a hundred years.

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:32.720
Why did you spend all that 
time hoarding wealth and life?

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:35.400
I have high ideals.

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:40.740
I desire eternal life, eternal pleasure, 
and eternal growth.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.290
Eternity is not stagnant.

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:48.550
I wish to be a powerful human 
who's constantly evolving.

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:52.270
At face value, you sound like someone 
with a high level of awareness,

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:56.160
but the question is how many people 
you've sacrificed to achieve that.

00:16:56.900 --> 00:17:01.660
It seems we should be parting ways here.

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:06.170
You wish to use Shinyao to erase 
all Umbra from this world.

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:11.590
And you want to capture Baileu Ton
 to reach greater heights.

00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:15.340
You seek the extermination of all Umbra.

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:20.470
You seek to acquire the power of all Umbra.

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:25.020
In other words, you want 
Shinyao to be yours forever.

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:29.770
Eventually you'll desire not just Ton,
 but Shinyao as well.

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:35.170
What now, Mr. Haysin?

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:36.610
Will you kill me?

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:40.920
It's the simplest solution, 
but it's too efficient.

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:43.330
I wouldn't grow.

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:46.630
Let's play one last game, then.

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:48.000
What are the rules?

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:51.110
We'll make our pawns as strong as possible

00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:53.700
and have them fight one another.

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:55.920
Winner takes all.

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:56.880
How does that sound?

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:59.440
Sounds interesting.

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:04.100
When will we conduct this battle?

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:15.700
Tonight.

00:18:35.470 --> 00:18:37.280
Let's begin.

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:39.250
Vlad, what is all this?

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.560
We're going to have the best of times.

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:43.140
What?

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:48.660
We're going to have a time so great

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:50.850
you'll believe you belong with us.

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:51.770
What are you—

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:54.270
This is the strongest 
ability I have right now.

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:56.990
Even more powerful than sucking your blood,

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:59.030
it is the ultimate curse.

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:03.610
Don't you mean the strongest
 ability <i>we</i> have?

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:06.830
It doesn't work without all of us.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:10.020
What an embarrassing mistake.

00:19:13.370 --> 00:19:17.160
Now taste my ultimate tea.

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:20.180
I clearly spent more time on mine.

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:50.040
It's time.

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:51.570
Let's go.

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:53.670
It's the final battle.

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:55.840
Where are they?

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:59.970
They're supposed to tell 
us the place. Right, Vlad?

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:00.800
Yeah.

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:04.260
This seems to be it.

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:05.930
The Tower of London.

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:07.660
Is Shinyao there?

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:10.000
We'll see once we get there.

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:22.780
Wayne, I have a request.

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:24.280
<i>What, Vlad?</i>

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:29.670
If we're defeated and it looks like Ton 
and Shinyao will fall into enemy hands...

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:32.390
<i>Don't say such ominous things.</i>

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:35.120
If that happens, you do something.

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:36.710
<i>Wait, what?</i>

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:38.850
They just need to survive.

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:41.620
I don't care if we get 
caught in the crossfire.

00:20:41.620 --> 00:20:43.330
Destroy it all.

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:45.890
<i>I don't understand what you mean, Vlad.</i>

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:49.810
I'm counting on you, Lord of Gluttony.

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:00.230
Jeez.

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:04.440
You're a coward, vampire.

00:22:35.250 --> 00:23:31.090
<b>Phantom 
Twilight Plus</b>

00:22:35.910 --> 00:22:37.990
Phantom in the Twilight Plus!

00:22:37.990 --> 00:22:40.440
It's time for this character 
to make an appearance.

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:41.730
Hello.

00:22:41.730 --> 00:22:45.100
I'm genius engineer, the real 
key figure of Midnight Sun,

00:22:45.100 --> 00:22:47.680
and donut-lover Backup.

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:51.450
Today we'll be talking about 
Mr. Backup's real name.

00:22:52.290 --> 00:22:56.680
Today we're changing the script and 
explaining your true identity, Evil Wayne.

00:22:56.680 --> 00:22:58.360
Please, Mr. Backup.

00:22:58.360 --> 00:23:01.190
I'm a totally ordinary 
ghost you'd find anywhere.

00:23:01.410 --> 00:23:04.750
Oh, no. You're not actually 
a weak little ghost.

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:06.810
You're a proper legendary Umbra.

00:23:06.810 --> 00:23:08.650
What proof do you have?

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:12.140
It took you only a second to destroy 
the entire Snowmary building.

00:23:12.140 --> 00:23:16.130
Um, I have no memories of that incident, 
so there's not enough evidence.

00:23:16.130 --> 00:23:18.610
The arrogant attitude, the immense power,

00:23:18.610 --> 00:23:22.120
and the cunning way you appear only 
occasionally to steal someone's thunder...

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:23.350
Please stop.

00:23:23.350 --> 00:23:28.270
In my opinion, your true identity is a 
demon with the power to destroy the world.

00:23:28.270 --> 00:23:30.780
I told you to stop, human.

00:23:30.780 --> 00:23:32.740
See? I knew it.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:50.200
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:36.820
Our enemies are at the Tower of London.

00:23:36.820 --> 00:23:38.350
The final battle is about to begin.

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:40.910
The ultimate four-person team 
charges into enemy lines.

00:23:40.910 --> 00:23:43.480
Vlad, Luke, Toryu, and Miss Ton.

00:23:43.480 --> 00:23:46.610
Huh? Aren't you guys forgetting 
an important member?

00:23:46.980 --> 00:23:50.200
<b>Episode 11 Final Battle in the Dark</b>

00:23:47.110 --> 00:23:49.640
Next time: Final Battle in the Dark.
